    "description": {
      "value": "Originally created as a means of slaying the legendary jabberwock, vorpal weapons prove equally effective against nearly any foe with a head.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Traits:** death, incapacitation\n- **Trigger:** You roll a natural 20 on a Strike with the weapon, critically succeed, and deal slashing damage.\n\nThe target must succeed at a DC 37 Fortitude save or be decapitated. This kills any creature except ones that don't require a head to live. For creatures with multiple heads, this usually kills the creature only if you sever its last head."
